"  taskstaka · all  1 Next  2 Outline  3 Waiting on·1  4 Someday·1  5 Nudges                         "
"  2 to do now · 1 doing · 4 blocked · 1 waiting on people · 1 someday                               "
"       ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐       "
"  ╭─ pa│ taskstaka — keys                                                                   │────╮  "
"  │ › 💤                                                                                    │2d  │  " Hidden by multi-width symbols: [(7, " ")]
"  ╰────│ 1 Next  2 Outline  3 Waiting on  4 Someday  5 Nudges     v cycles                  │────╯  "
"       │ j / k, ↑ / ↓     move        g / G   first / last     l   fold / unfold later      │       "
"       │ d                done        x       drop             o   reopen                   │       "
"       │ s                start (takes it in hand)   p   put back (another comes up)        │       "
"       │ i                first I need to… — a prerequisite under the selection;            │       "
"       │                  from the task in hand it goes in hand and pauses the one above    │       "
"       │ w                wait on someone (append ' @ +3d' for a follow-up date)            │       "
"       │ f                chase them    u   unblock / revive — it is ready, you are on it   │       "
"       │ z                someday      t       touch, with an optional note                 │       "
"       │ a                add task (on Someday: park an idea)    A   add under selection    │       "
"       │ e / Enter        open the note in $EDITOR                                          │       "
"       │ ⇧↑ / ⇧↓          move among siblings · ⇧→ nest under row above · ⇧← out            │       "
"       │ space            show / hide the details box        Esc   hide it                  │       "
"       │ h                show / hide completed (outline)    c   cycle context              │       "
"       │ r                refresh     q       quit                                          │       "
"       │                                                                                    │       "
"       │ Nesting means 'first this'; siblings are independent. Next shows the task in       │       "
"       │ hand, then per story what you can do now; '… N later' is what is still required.   │       "
"       │                                                                                    │       "
"       │ any key to close                                                                   │       "
"       └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘       "
"                                                                                                    "
"  j/k move · u revive · a park an idea · d done · x drop · space details · ? help · q quit          "
